    "corrections": [
      "0476: joined curved floor and roof bays, preserved deliberate roof gap then closure; wiping cloth and pause palm meet posts; support carried at hand height; chair and feet sit on stable floor; final seated posture meets chair, palm meets post, waist toolbag removed after putting it beside chair. Movement scenes keep people off the corridor.",
      "0477: supported sleeping pose and blanket redrawn; shared paper/pencil hand contacts corrected, blank consent page and incomplete early dream map distinguished from final route; seated figures supported; three connected tidal pools explicitly visible only on final scenes and cover; small whale has three blue spots; waking reader remains a labeled inset in dream reunion."
    ],
    "limitations": "Original simplified geometric artwork. Complete contact sheets plus fifteen distinct closeups, not every page separately at original resolution; not human full audio listening."
